<p><img style="display: block; float: right; margin: 5px 10px 5px 10px;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/science-technology-environment-white-back.jpg" alt="Green Meta Major" width="184" height="183" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Physics Department at Lake Tahoe Community College offers general physics courses for students interested in engineering, mathematics, and those needing to fulfill their physical science GE requirements.</p>
<p>An Associate Degree is offered in the field of <a title="Liberal Arts" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/academic_programs/liberal_arts.php">Liberal Arts with an emphasis in Mathematics &amp; Science &rarr;</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
